# shadcn/ui

Official registry: https://ui.shadcn.com/

- Import from `@/components/ui/*` (see `components.json`).
- Add missing pieces with `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <name>` — do not hand-roll a parallel Button, Dialog, Select, or Input.
- Style with Tailwind tokens (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `text-primary`). Keep the light zinc/emerald theme. No extra CSS frameworks.
- Session logging stays a dense table (TanStack Table), not a one-set-per-screen wizard.
- Leave generated files under `src/components/ui` alone unless a shadcn upgrade requires it.

```tsx
// BAD
<button className="rounded bg-green-600 px-3 py-1">Save</button>

// GOOD
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'
<Button>Save</Button>
```
